          <outline text="Capacity is the ceiling. Plan is the number the Head is held to: 60 percent fill at launch, 75 percent in Session 3, 90 percent in Session 4, full in Session 5. Floor is every cohort at 25 percent fill all year, roughly the level at which the cohort floor would start closing cohorts.">
          </outline>
